 "what_the_pages_show": [
  "Every page carries several labelled sets. PICKUP, ORDER_AHEAD and WALK_IN end 15 minutes before STORE. All The Places' Dunkin' closing times are those, not the STORE set.",
  "The pages show the current week: Thursday 2026-11-26 carried Thanksgiving hours (05:00-14:00, 06:00-20:00, or 00:00-00:00 for closed), and three of the six pages had changed since 2026-11-24.",
  "00:00-00:00 means closed on some days (Thanksgiving; Sunday at a weekday store) and open 24 hours on others (Friday and Saturday at an overnight store).",
  "The four stores answer under www.dunkindonuts.com/locations/us/<state>/<city>/<address>/store-<number>/. The addresses our records tried (locations.dunkindonuts.com/en/..., and one with a stray /b) no longer answer; the stores are still there."
 ]
